# Admin Role

Operations Manager only: monitor students/instructors/courses/certificates, support tickets, operational reports. No system config, finance, research, roles, or user creation.

## Sidebar

Dashboard · Students · Instructors · Courses · Certificates · Support Tickets · Reports · Notifications · Profile · Logout

## Dashboard

Stats: Total Students, Total Instructors, Total Courses, Active Courses, Open Support Tickets, Total Users (**students + instructors**).
**No** revenue/expenses/profit/withdrawals/shareholders (Finance only).
Recent Support Tickets + Recent Users. Notifications via header only.
Professional copy only — no “monitor only” or academic-permission disclaimers.

## Key rules

- Students: view + download only — **never** enable/disable/delete (disable is Super Admin only)
- Instructors & Courses: view only (no approve/reject/create)
- Certificates: review student requests + upload issued certificate file
- Support: reply, reopen; priority = high | medium | urgent; status = open | resolved
- Academic actions (approve courses/certs/activations): only if Super Admin grants; default view-only
- No finance, payments, research, system settings, roles, or user creation
